  "historical_output_text": " Subject: Clarification of Routine Process and Open Forum for Questions\n\nDear Team,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to clarify our routine process for project approval and to ensure everyone is on the same page. The process typically involves the following steps:\n\n1. **Initial Proposal**: Project managers submit their proposals to the team lead.\n2. **Team Lead Review**: The team lead reviews the proposal for alignment with our goals and feasibility.\n3. **Approval**: Once approved by the team lead, the project moves to the next phase, which is reviewed by our department head.\n4. **Final Approval**: The department head provides final approval, and the project can proceed.\n\nFor any questions or clarifications related to this process, I invite you to reach out to me or the team lead at your earliest convenience. We are here to support you",
